[h2]Build 0.9.31[/h2]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*]An arm whose gripper reaches into a shelf or crate now takes from the whole storage, not just the piece at its gripper: every storage building of the same kind joined to it in a row, and every one linked to it with Link settings (up to 40 buildings). Stockpile zones already counted as a whole.
[/list]
